### Project and student identity
GET http://localhost:8080/api/info

### Actual backend response
GET http://localhost:8080/api/hello

### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Classroom state
GET http://localhost:8080/api/lab

### Start a candidate
POST http://localhost:8080/api/lab
Content-Type: application/json

{"action":"start","version":"v1.1.0"}

### Generate a simulated batch
POST http://localhost:8080/api/lab
Content-Type: application/json

{"action":"traffic"}

### Advance only after a healthy batch
POST http://localhost:8080/api/lab
Content-Type: application/json

{"action":"advance"}

### Toggle failure injection
POST http://localhost:8080/api/lab
Content-Type: application/json

{"action":"fault"}

### Manual rollback
POST http://localhost:8080/api/lab
Content-Type: application/json

{"action":"rollback"}

### Reset classroom state
POST http://localhost:8080/api/lab
Content-Type: application/json

{"action":"reset"}
